{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233350","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233350","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1423335001:1":{"text":"Hey there, why are you all alone and crying? Where are your friends? The grown-ups are worried. You should head back soon.","source_cn":"小朋友，你怎么一个人在这里哭呀？你的朋友呢？大人很担心...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F91EA36C9B5F5A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423335002:1":{"text":"*Sobbing* We were playing tag and I was the ghost, but they all ran off so fast! I lost sight of them and couldn't catch up!","source_cn":"……呜……我们在玩扮鬼抓人的游戏，可是他们跑得好快，一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF60CE9526EF26D59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423335003:1":{"text":"I found Jules for a second, but then he ran off again... I didn't want to quit, but being alone out here is scary...","source_cn":"好不容易找到了朱尔，可是朱尔又跑掉了……追不上他们，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x688B2873A8B87C65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423335004:1":{"text":"If we help you find your friends, would you be good and go home?","source_cn":"如果我们帮你找到朋友的话，你是不是就愿意回家了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBBD2661418DBC84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"